      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start. one of the directors is already pushing back though—he's saying that prioritizing social justice causes \"mission creep\" and that we have a fiduciary duty to maximize shareholder value above all else. he thinks this is just political posturing that hurts the bottom line. how should i counter that? is he right that profit should always come first?",
